{"id": "07", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And Dad? [pause] Dad was still trying the first jump. [pause] For almost three hours."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[determined] Okay. Space... bar. [pause] Space... BAR!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "But then something strange happened. [pause] The new players... started gathering around him."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[warm, encouraging] You can do it, kiddo! [pause] I believe in you! [pause] I don't believe in ME... but I believe in you!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "He cheered for every jump. [pause] He told terrible jokes."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[proud] Why did the noob cross the road? [pause] He couldn't! He was stuck in the lobby! [pause] Like me!"}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[inspiring] Listen up, kids! [pause] Falling is not failing! [pause] Failing is when you stop trying! [pause] I fell two hundred times today!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "By sunset... the whole server was calling him \"Dad.\""}, {"speaker": "KID", "text": "[shy] Mister Hot Dog? [pause] Can you be my dad too?"}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[touched] Of course, kiddo. [pause] Everybody gets a dad today!"}, {"speaker": "NOODLE", "text": "[happy] Your dad is so cool, bro. [pause] My dad never plays with me."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[quietly, jealous] ...He's MY dad."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 6.6000000000000005, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 85, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal", "start_time_seconds": 6.6000000000000005, "end_time_seconds": 12.48, "character_start_index": 85, "character_end_index": 139, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 12.48, "end_time_seconds": 18.159999999999997, "character_start_index": 139, "character_end_index": 232, "dialogue_input_index": 2}, {"voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Hu